  'SNYK-JAVA-ORGSPRINGFRAMEWORK-18326606':
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          CVE-2026-41851 in org.springframework:spring-expression@5.3.27. Transitive dep of
          artifactory-papi (papi 7.68.5 > artifactory-utils 7.68.5 > spring-context 5.3.27 >
          spring-expression 5.3.27). Actual papi is provided by artifactory env at runtime so this
          is a false positive. Not reachable by an upgrade either: the fix versions are 6.0.0 /
          6.2.19 / 7.0.8 and no artifactory-papi release moves off the Spring 5.3 line. Current
          Snyk ID as of 2026-09-11; Snyk lists exactly one ID for this CVE on this package version,
          so there is no retired generation to pair it with.
        expires: 2026-10-11T00:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-09-11T00:00:00.000Z
